| 717 | `hir_const_type_settled(type_)` | c1 | settled / infer |
| 718 | `definition.kind == Const` | c1 | L718 Const (T) / Variable (F) |

Documented gaps (unreachable): L36 F and L427 c2 F (an instance method always
carries the explicit receiver param, so its params are never empty), L72 F
(non-optional field), L397 F (`if val` excludes nil), L400 c2 (masked by
